        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "7968a300-c87d-525f-a5e0-44607ed3e2c7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ritesh Sidhwani, Farhan Akhtar, Karan Anshuman, Kumud Mishra, Aamir Khan, Saif Ali Khan, Akshaye Khanna, Preity Zinta, Sonali Kulkarni, Dimple Kapadia, Riteish Deshmukh, Pulkit Samrat, Chandan Roy Sanyal, Akshay Kumar\n- Companies: Excel Entertainment Pvt. Ltd.\n- Films: Dil Chahta Hai, Bangistan, Filmistaan, Revolver Rani, Jolly LLB 2, Raanjhanaa, Badlapur, Airlift\n- Roles: Sanjeev Kohli\n- Topics: Bollywood film production, acting credits\n\nFacts:\n- Ritesh Sidhwani, born in 1973, is a Bollywood film producer.\n- Ritesh Sidhwani founded the film production house Excel Entertainment Pvt. Ltd.\n- In 2001, Dil Chahta Hai was released as an Indian comedy-drama film.\n- Dil Chahta Hai was Ritesh Sidhwani's first film under the Excel Entertainment banner, and he brought it to audiences with his long-time friend Farhan Akhtar.\n- Dil Chahta Hai starred Aamir Khan, Saif Ali Khan, Akshaye Khanna, Preity Zinta, Sonali Kulkarni, and Dimple Kapadia.\n- In 2015, Bangistan was released as a Bollywood comedy satire film directed by Karan Anshuman.\n- Bangistan was produced by Farhan Akhtar and Ritesh Sidhwani.\n- Bangistan starred Riteish Deshmukh, Pulkit Samrat, and Chandan Roy Sanyal in lead roles.\n- Kumud Mishra has had roles in Filmistaan, Revolver Rani, Jolly LLB 2, Raanjhanaa, Badlapur, and Bangistan.\n- In Airlift, Kumud Mishra played the substantial role of Sanjeev Kohli alongside Akshay Kumar.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
